                                                "sense_id": "131c9696-dbd1-300e-8609-f10e9d15b66f",
                                                "text": "The dearest interests of parties have frequently been staked on the results of the researches of antiquaries."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99a0887c-2bb4-47e3-b0f4-244427a9801e",
                                                "sense_id": "131c9696-dbd1-300e-8609-f10e9d15b66f",
                                                "text": "The first step I took in this so necessary a research, was to examine the motives, the justice, the necessity and expediency of the revolution[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6b2a8fc-9b34-462c-a3f1-e54d602c1369",
                                                "sense_id": "131c9696-dbd1-300e-8609-f10e9d15b66f",
                                                "text": "Although very numerous researches have been made on the differentiation of striped muscles, and on the termination of their motor nerve-fibres, yet the multifarious observations have often been too incomplete to lead to any but conflicting and unsatisfactory theories."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
